---
title: "firebase_data_migration (kintai-v3 企画書: 部活動勤怠管理システム)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_init: migration process started
    q_init --> q_export: export data from Firebase
    q_export --> q_validate_source: Firebase data exported
    q_validate_source --> q_transform: source data validated (schema check)
    q_validate_source --> q_error_source: source data invalid
    q_error_source --> [*]: abort migration with error report
    q_transform --> q_map_schema: transform Firebase documents to PostgreSQL schema
    q_map_schema --> q_import: schema mapping complete
    q_import --> q_insert: batch insert into Supabase PostgreSQL
    q_insert --> q_verify: insertion complete
    q_verify --> q_compare: compare record counts (Firebase vs PostgreSQL)
    q_compare --> q_success: counts match, data integrity verified
    q_compare --> q_error_mismatch: count mismatch detected
    q_error_mismatch --> [*]: abort with mismatch report
    q_success --> [*]: migration complete

    note right of q_validate_source
        INV-001: all Firebase records must be exported before transformation
        INV-002: source data schema is validated against expected format
    end note

    note right of q_map_schema
        INV-003: Firebase document IDs are mapped to PostgreSQL primary keys
        INV-004: timestamp formats are normalized (Firebase to ISO 8601)
    end note

    note right of q_compare
        INV-005: record count in PostgreSQL equals record count from Firebase
        INV-006: no data loss during migration (complete data transfer)
    end note
